      <data key="d0">Basal cell carcinoma</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A type of skin cancer, the most common type of skin cancer, which is highly treatable and can often be cured.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-004</data>
