      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A condition where scars or chronic wounds develop into squamous cell carcinoma.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of skin cancer that develops in old wounds.&lt;SEP&gt;A condition where squamous cell skin cancer forms in old wounds, burns, or scars.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-007</data>
