    <node id="Blood tests">
      <data key="d0">Blood tests</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Blood tests are laboratory procedures designed to analyze blood samples for various purposes. These tests can include the measurement of hormones in blood, urine, and saliva to diagnose conditions such as adrenal tumors. They also encompass a broad range of diagnostic methods aimed at assessing blood composition and function, examining blood samples for abnormalities, and providing insights into general health and organ function. Blood tests are crucial in medical diagnostics, particularly for detecting and monitoring diseases like pancreatic and prostate cancers. By analyzing blood samples, these tests help healthcare professionals identify and manage health issues effectively.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-077&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-079&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-093&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-123&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-137&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-161</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
