    <node id="MRI">
      <data key="d0">MRI</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">MRI, also known as Magnetic Resonance Imaging, is a medical imaging technique that utilizes magnetic fields and radio waves to produce detailed images of internal structures within the body. This non-invasive procedure allows healthcare professionals to visualize various parts of the body without exposing patients to ionizing radiation, making it a valuable tool in diagnosing and monitoring a wide range of medical conditions. MRI technology employs a powerful magnet to align hydrogen atoms in the body, which then interact with radio waves to generate detailed cross-sectional images. These images can reveal structural abnormalities, tumors, and other pathologies that might be difficult to detect through other imaging methods. MRI is particularly useful in examining soft tissues such as the brain, spine, muscles, and joints, providing doctors with crucial insights for treatment planning and patient care.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-041&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-042&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-053&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-060&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-072&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-082&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-090&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-091&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-114&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-123&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-135&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-137&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-139&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-143&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-152&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-156&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-166&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-167&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-177&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-187&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-191</data>
