    <node id="Radiation Therapy">
      <data key="d0">Radiation Therapy</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A cancer treatment that uses beams of intense energy to kill cancer cells.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of cancer treatment that uses high-energy rays to kill cancer cells.&lt;SEP&gt;A cancer treatment that uses high-energy radiation to kill cancer cells.&lt;SEP&gt;An advanced radiation technique used to treat anal cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-113&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-116&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-154&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-190&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-197</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1788522040</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="External Beam Radiation Therapy (EBRT)">
      <data key="d0">External Beam Radiation Therapy (EBRT)</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A type of radiation therapy where a beam of radiation is directed at the tumor from a machine.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-009</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1788522040</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Brachytherapy">
      <data key="d0">Brachytherapy</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A type of radiation therapy where a radiation source is placed close to or in direct contact with the tumor.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of radiation therapy where radioactive material is placed directly into or near the tumor.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of radiation therapy that involves treatment with radioactive material placed inside the body.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of radiotherapy where radioactive material is placed close to the cancer cells to deliver a high dose of radiation.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-137&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-140&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-144</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1788522040</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Lymph nodes">
      <data key="d0">Lymph nodes</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Lymph nodes are small, bean-shaped structures that play a crucial role in the immune system. They are distributed throughout the body and filter lymph fluid, which helps in removing bacteria, viruses, and other harmful substances. These glands also produce immune cells and aid in fighting infections and diseases. Lymph nodes are part of the lymphatic system and are essential for maintaining the body's defense against pathogens. They are often found in groups, such as those near the armpit, which drain breast tissue into lymph vessels. Overall, lymph nodes are vital components of the immune system, filtering lymph fluid and helping to protect the body from infections and diseases.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-049&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-056&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-060&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-076&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-081&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-095&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-125&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-126&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-142&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-151&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-158&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-173&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-177&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-179&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-192</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1788522044</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Lymph Node">
      <data key="d0">Lymph Node</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">A small, bean-shaped organ part of the lymphatic system that filters lymph and helps fight infection.&lt;SEP&gt;Small, bean-shaped structures that filter lymph and produce immune cells.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-170</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1788522044</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Anesthesia">
      <data key="d0">Anesthesia</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A state of induced unconsciousness or insensitivity to pain during a medical procedure.&lt;SEP&gt;A medical intervention that induces temporary loss of sensation and awareness during a medical or dental procedure.&lt;SEP&gt;A state of induced unconsciousness and insensitivity to pain achieved through the administration of drugs.&lt;SEP&gt;A medication that induces a state of unconsciousness and loss of pain sensation during a medical procedure.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-091&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-135&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-167</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1788522044</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Chemotherapy">
      <data key="d0">Chemotherapy</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Chemotherapy is a type of systemic therapy that uses drugs to kill fast-growing cancer cells. It is employed to treat various types of cancer, including acute myeloid leukemia (AML), by targeting fast-dividing cells throughout the body. Chemotherapy often involves cycles of drug administration followed by rest periods to allow the body to recover. This treatment approach is also utilized for advanced-stage prostate cancer and anal cancer, where it can sometimes lead to infertility due to its impact on reproductive cells. Chemotherapy is a drug therapy that works throughout the body, designed to kill cancer cells and is considered a systemic therapy, meaning that the drugs travel in the bloodstream to reach and affect cells throughout the body.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-038&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-039&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-062&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-072&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-073&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-081&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-088&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-109&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-110&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-113&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-116&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-117&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-125&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-138&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-142&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-149&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-175&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-183&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-185&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-188&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-189&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-190&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-191&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-192&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-194&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-197</data>
