      <data key="d0">Lupus</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">An autoimmune disease that causes inflammation in various parts of the body.&lt;SEP&gt;Autoimmune disease characterized by the immune system attacking healthy tissues and organs</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-112</data>
