    <node id="Pathologist">
      <data key="d0">Pathologist</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Pathologists are medical professionals who specialize in the examination of tissues and bodily fluids to diagnose diseases. They analyze cells and tissues to provide cancer diagnoses and examine tissue samples to determine the presence of disease and its nature. Pathologists use microscopes to examine tissues and fluids, and they also analyze cells, tissues, and organs. Their primary role involves providing diagnostic reports based on the examination of tissue samples and cells. Pathologists are crucial in the medical field, contributing significantly to the accurate diagnosis of various diseases through their specialized expertise in tissue and cell analysis.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-042&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-073&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-079&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-084&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-091&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-099&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-117&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-129&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-147&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-151</data>
