      <data key="d1">other</data>
      <data key="d2">A platinum chemotherapy used to treat squamous cell skin cancer and other cancers.&lt;SEP&gt;A chemotherapy drug used to treat various cancers.&lt;SEP&gt;A chemotherapy drug used in the treatment of various cancers, including cervical cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-109&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-145</data>
