    <node id="Cisplatin">
      <data key="d0">Cisplatin</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Cisplatin is a platinum-based chemotherapy drug used in the treatment of various cancers, including squamous cell skin cancer, bladder cancer, cervical cancer, and anal cancer. It is also commonly used in regimens for treating anal cancer. As a type of chemotherapy drug, cisplatin plays a significant role in the management of multiple cancer types, demonstrating its versatility and effectiveness across different malignancies.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-109&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-140&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-144&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-145&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-183&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-190&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-191&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-194</data>
