      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A PD-1 inhibitor used to treat squamous cell skin cancer and other cancers.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific immunotherapy drug used in the treatment of certain types of cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;An immune checkpoint inhibitor used in the treatment of various cancers, including cervical cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of immunotherapy drug used to treat certain cancers.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-125&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-145&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-157</data>
