    <node id="Informed consent">
      <data key="d0">Informed consent</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The process where a research team reviews a study with a participant in detail, including its purpose and the risks and benefits of joining.&lt;SEP&gt;A process where a patient agrees to participate in a clinical trial after being fully informed about the risks and benefits.&lt;SEP&gt;The process of providing detailed information about a clinical trial to a participant and obtaining their agreement to participate.&lt;SEP&gt;An agreement confirming that a participant has been fully informed about their role in a clinical trial and has agreed to participate.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-117&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-149&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-184</data>
