    <node id="Chronic myeloid leukemia (CML)">
      <data key="d0">Chronic myeloid leukemia (CML)</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A type of blood cancer characterized by an abnormal gene called BCR::ABL1.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of blood cancer caused by a single, specific abnormal gene.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-074</data>
