      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Early blood-forming cells that give rise to red blood cells, white blood cells, and platelets.&lt;SEP&gt;Cells that give rise to all blood cell types.&lt;SEP&gt;Cells that make an increased amount of myeloid progenitor cells in CML.</data>
