      <data key="d2">Cells that mature into lymphocytes.&lt;SEP&gt;Cells that develop into lymphoid blood cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Immature lymphocytes that can crowd out normal bone marrow in acute lymphoblastic leukemia.&lt;SEP&gt;Immature lymphocytes that can crowd out normal bone marrow in acute lymphoblastic leukemia (ALL).&lt;SEP&gt;Immature lymphocytes produced in the bone marrow in acute lymphoblastic leukemia (ALL).</data>
