      <data key="d2">Sections within the NCCN Guidelines for Patients that suggest questions for patients to ask their care team.&lt;SEP&gt;A section in the book that suggests questions to ask healthcare providers.&lt;SEP&gt;Sections at the end of each chapter in the book that suggest questions to help readers get more information on cancer care.&lt;SEP&gt;Sections within the book that suggest questions to ask healthcare providers to better understand cancer care.&lt;SEP&gt;Sections at the end of each chapter in the book that provide suggestions for questions to ask healthcare providers.</data>
