      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A type of cancer that arises in the lungs.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of cancer that originates in the cells lining the lungs, leading to abnormal cell growth and potentially spreading to other parts of the body.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of cancer that originates in the lungs</data>
