      <data key="d0">Non-small cell lung cancer (NSCLC)</data>
      <data key="d1">disease</data>
      <data key="d2">The most common type of lung cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;A category of lung cancer that includes various subtypes such as adenocarcinoma, squamous cell carcinoma, adenosquamous carcinoma, large cell carcinoma, and sarcomatoid carcinoma.</data>
