      <data key="d2">Smaller airways in the lungs that branch off from the bronchi.&lt;SEP&gt;Small airways in the lungs that branch off from the bronchi</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-020</data>
