      <data key="d0">Stage 3</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A stage of lung cancer indicating growth from the airway into lung tissue and possible spread to lymph nodes.&lt;SEP&gt;Invasive breast cancer, rated stage 3, where the cancer has grown outside the ducts, lobules, or breast skin, and might be in the axillary lymph nodes.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-108</data>
