    <node id="Stage 4">
      <data key="d0">Stage 4</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The most advanced stage of lung cancer, indicating spread to the tissue lining around the lung or to other organs.&lt;SEP&gt;A classification of ovarian cancer where cancer has spread to other parts of the body.&lt;SEP&gt;Metastatic breast cancer, rated stage 4, where cancer has spread to distant sites, and can develop from earlier stages.</data>
