    <node id="Lungs">
      <data key="d0">Lungs</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">A pair of organs located in the chest.&lt;SEP&gt;Two air-filled sacs in the chest that allow breathing and exchange gases with the blood.&lt;SEP&gt;Two air-filled sacs in the chest that allow breathing and gas exchange.&lt;SEP&gt;The organs in the chest that allow breathing.&lt;SEP&gt;Two air-filled sacs in the chest that take in oxygen and expel carbon dioxide.&lt;SEP&gt;The organs in the respiratory system responsible for breathing.&lt;SEP&gt;Two air-filled sacs in the chest that are part of the respiratory system and involved in breathing.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-060&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-081&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-126&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-144&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-174&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-192&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-003</data>
