      <data key="d0">Small cell lung cancer (SCLC)</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A fast-dividing cancer of the neuroendocrine cells in the lungs, characterized by small and oval-shaped cancer cells under a microscope.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-019</data>
