    <node id="Secondhand smoke">
      <data key="d0">Secondhand smoke</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Smoke exhaled by another person and the smoke from combustible tobacco products, which increases the risk of lung cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Smoke exhaled by another person and the smoke from combustible tobacco products</data>
