      <data key="d2">An organ in the abdomen that produces enzymes and hormones essential for digestion and blood sugar regulation.&lt;SEP&gt;A gland located deep inside the body, below the liver and behind the stomach.&lt;SEP&gt;A gland that produces enzymes and hormones essential for digestion and blood sugar regulation.</data>
