      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The innermost layer of the esophagus that lines the tube and secretes mucus.&lt;SEP&gt;The innermost layer of the stomach wall that lines the stomach.&lt;SEP&gt;The inner lining of the stomach wall.</data>
