      <data key="d2">The second layer of the esophagus wall that lies beneath the mucosa.&lt;SEP&gt;A layer of connective tissue, blood vessels, and nerve cells beneath the mucosa.&lt;SEP&gt;A layer beneath the mucosa in the stomach wall.</data>
