    <node id="Lymphoma">
      <data key="d0">Lymphoma</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A group of cancers that originate in the lymphatic system.&lt;SEP&gt;Cancer that forms from lymphocytes&lt;SEP&gt;An abnormal overgrowth of lymphocytes, which are white blood cells that fight infections.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of blood cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-112&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-113&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-186</data>
