      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A type of cancer that affects various parts of the mouth, including the lips, tongue, gums, and lining inside the cheeks and lips.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of cancer that develops in any part of the mouth.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of cancer that arises in the oral cavity.</data>
