      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A group of cancers that arise in the head or neck area of the body, including mouth cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;A group of cancers that arise in the head or neck area of the body.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of cancer that affects the head and neck region.</data>
