      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Information about the health history of family members who are blood relatives.&lt;SEP&gt;Information about the health history of blood relatives, including details about diseases and cancers that may run in families.&lt;SEP&gt;Information about the diseases and health conditions in a family, reflecting patterns of certain diseases among family members.&lt;SEP&gt;Information about the health history of blood relatives, used to identify potential hereditary diseases.&lt;SEP&gt;A record of the health history of family members.&lt;SEP&gt;Information about the health history of blood relatives, including cancers and other diseases.</data>
