      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Diagnostic procedures that produce images of internal structures.&lt;SEP&gt;Tests that take pictures of the inside of the body to look for sites with leukemia outside the bone marrow.&lt;SEP&gt;Diagnostic procedures that produce images of internal structures of the body, such as CT scans and MRIs.&lt;SEP&gt;Procedures that take pictures of the inside of the body to detect cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Diagnostic procedures that create images of internal body structures.&lt;SEP&gt;Diagnostic procedures that produce images of internal structures of the body.</data>
