    <node id="FDG-PET/CT">
      <data key="d0">FDG-PET/CT</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A diagnostic imaging technique that combines positron emission tomography (PET) and computed tomography (CT) to visualize metabolic activity in the body.&lt;SEP&gt;A diagnostic imaging technique combining PET and CT scans.&lt;SEP&gt;A medical imaging technique that combines positron emission tomography (PET) and computed tomography (CT) to visualize metabolic activity in the body.&lt;SEP&gt;A combined PET and CT scan that uses a specific radiotracer to identify cancer cells.&lt;SEP&gt;A medical imaging technique that combines PET and CT scans to detect cancer cells in the body.</data>
