    <node id="smoking">
      <data key="d0">smoking</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">The act of inhaling and exhaling smoke from a burning tobacco product.&lt;SEP&gt;The act of inhaling and exhaling smoke from a burning substance, typically tobacco.&lt;SEP&gt;The act of inhaling and exhaling smoke from a burning substance, particularly tobacco, which increases the risk of bladder cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-031&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-051&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-178</data>
