      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The spread of cancer from its primary site to another part of the body.&lt;SEP&gt;The process where cancer cells spread to other parts of the body.&lt;SEP&gt;The spread of cancer to an area of the body such as lymph nodes or lung.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-096&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-130</data>
