    <node id="mutation">
      <data key="d0">mutation</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">An alteration in the DNA sequence that can lead to changes in the function of a gene.&lt;SEP&gt;A change in the DNA sequence that can lead to a new trait or disease.&lt;SEP&gt;A change in the DNA sequence that can lead to a disease.&lt;SEP&gt;An error in the genetic code that can lead to changes in the proteins cells make.&lt;SEP&gt;An abnormal change in DNA that can disrupt cellular behavior and lead to diseases like cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-031&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-044&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-055&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-092&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-130&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-168</data>
