      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">A molecule that carries genetic information and is essential for life.&lt;SEP&gt;Deoxyribonucleic acid, a molecule that carries the genetic instructions used in the development and functioning of all known living organisms.&lt;SEP&gt;A molecule containing the genetic instructions used in the development and functioning of all known living organisms.&lt;SEP&gt;A molecule that carries the genetic instructions used in the development and functioning of all known living organisms.&lt;SEP&gt;Deoxyribonucleic acid, a molecule tightly packaged into chromosomes that contains genetic information in a cell.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-031&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-036&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-084&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-092&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-130</data>
