    <node id="TNM system">
      <data key="d0">TNM system</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A system used to stage cancer based on the size, location, and spread of the tumor.&lt;SEP&gt;A system used to stage throat cancer based on the depth and size of the main tumor, whether cancer has spread to nearby lymph nodes, and whether cancer has spread to distant parts of the body.&lt;SEP&gt;A classification system used to describe the extent of cancer growth.&lt;SEP&gt;A system used to stage breast cancer based on the size of the tumor, the presence of lymph node involvement, and the presence of distant metastasis.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-031&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-056&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-093&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-107</data>
