    <node id="lymph node">
      <data key="d0">lymph node</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">A small, bean-shaped organ found throughout the body that plays a role in the immune system.&lt;SEP&gt;A lymph node is a small, bean-shaped organ that is part of the lymphatic system. It filters lymph fluid and helps fight infection.&lt;SEP&gt;A sample of a lymph node.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-031&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-104&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-130</data>
