    <node id="TNM scores">
      <data key="d0">TNM scores</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Scores or numbers assigned to the letters T, N, and M in the TNM system to stage cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;A system used to classify the extent of cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;A system used to stage cancer based on&lt;SEP&gt;A system used to stage cancer based on tumor size, lymph node status, and distant metastasis.&lt;SEP&gt;Scores or numbers assigned to the tumor, node, and metastasis (TNM) system to stage cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;A system used to stage most bone cancers, where T, N, and M describe different areas of cancer growth.&lt;SEP&gt;Scores used in staging cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-031&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-032&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-055&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-106&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-131&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-158&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-172</data>
