    <node id="Complete blood count (CBC)">
      <data key="d0">Complete blood count (CBC)</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A blood test that measures the levels of red blood cells, white blood cells, and platelets.&lt;SEP&gt;A laboratory test that measures the levels of various components in the blood, including red blood cells, white blood cells, and platelets.&lt;SEP&gt;A blood test that measures the number of red blood&lt;SEP&gt;Measures the levels of red blood cells, white blood cells, and platelets in the blood.</data>
