      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A blood test that measures the level of uric acid, a waste product in the blood.&lt;SEP&gt;A substance produced by the body that can be measured in the blood to assess kidney function and the risk of gout.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-034&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-068</data>
