      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A change in the DNA sequence that can lead to a change in the protein produced.&lt;SEP&gt;An abnormality in the genetic code that can lead to changes in genes and chromosomes.&lt;SEP&gt;An abnormal change in the DNA sequence that can lead to a disease.&lt;SEP&gt;A change in the DNA sequence of a gene.</data>
