      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A method that involves special dyes called probes that attach to pieces of DNA to look for changes that are too small to be seen with other methods.&lt;SEP&gt;A testing method that uses special dyes to attach to pieces of DNA.&lt;SEP&gt;A technique used to detect specific genetic material in cells.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-036&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-105&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-171</data>
