    <node id="Pharynx">
      <data key="d0">Pharynx</data>
      <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
      <data key="d2">A hollow, muscular tube inside the neck that serves as a passageway for air and food.&lt;SEP&gt;Part of the throat and found inside the neck. It is a hollow, muscular tube that starts behind the nose (nasal cavity) and opens into the voice box (larynx) and esophagus (the tube that goes to the stomach).</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-049&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-126</data>
