    </node>
    <node id="Nasopharynx">
      <data key="d0">Nasopharynx</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">Part of the pharynx located behind the nose.&lt;SEP&gt;A small, tube-shaped structure above the soft part of the back of the mouth (soft palate) that connects the nasal cavity to the oropharynx.&lt;SEP&gt;The part of the body connecting the back of the nose to the back of the mouth.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-049&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-126&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-127</data>
