      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A type of cancer that arises in the space behind the nose.&lt;SEP&gt;A rare cancer that most often occurs in people from parts of Asia, Native America, and North Africa.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of cancer that affects the nasopharynx.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of cancer that starts in the nasopharynx.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-049&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-126&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-128&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-131</data>
