    <node id="Fertility">
      <data key="d0">Fertility</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The ability to conceive and carry a pregnancy to term.&lt;SEP&gt;The ability to conceive and give birth to offspring.&lt;SEP&gt;The ability to conceive and carry a child to full term.&lt;SEP&gt;The ability to have children, which can be affected by certain treatments for bone cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;The ability to produce children, which can be affected by anal cancer treatment methods like radiation therapy and chemotherapy.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-052&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-077&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-123&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-154&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-188</data>
