    <node id="Imaging">
      <data key="d0">Imaging</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Tests that can show areas of cancer inside the body, helping to stage the cancer and plan treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Diagnostic procedures used to visualize internal structures of the body, aiding in the diagnosis and staging of pancreatic and prostate cancers.&lt;SEP&gt;A diagnostic technique used to visualize internal structures of the body.&lt;SEP&gt;Medical imaging techniques used to determine the extent of cancer before treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Medical imaging techniques used to visualize internal structures.&lt;SEP&gt;Diagnostic procedures that use imaging technology to visualize internal structures and assess the extent of cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Taking detailed pictures of the insides of the body to show the size, location, and other features of cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-059&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-079&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-123&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-137&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-174&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-175&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-177</data>
