      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A procedure where unfertilized eggs are collected, frozen, and stored for later use.&lt;SEP&gt;A process where unfertilized eggs are removed, frozen, and stored for later use in fertility preservation.&lt;SEP&gt;A fertility preservation method that stores unfertilized eggs for later use by freezing them.</data>
