      <data key="d2">A surgical procedure connecting a part of the colon to the outside of the abdomen, creating an opening for stool to exit the body.&lt;SEP&gt;A surgical procedure that creates an opening in the abdomen to allow waste products to exit the body.&lt;SEP&gt;A surgical procedure that creates an opening in the abdomen to allow stool to exit the body.&lt;SEP&gt;A surgical procedure to create a permanent opening in the abdomen through which waste passes directly into a bag outside the body.</data>
