      <data key="d2">Advanced-stage prostate cancer that has spread to the lymph nodes, bones, liver, lungs, and other organs.&lt;SEP&gt;Advanced-stage prostate cancer that has spread outside the prostate to other parts of the body.&lt;SEP&gt;Advanced-stage prostate cancer that has spread to other areas in the body.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-080&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-088</data>
