      <data key="d0">Enlarged prostate</data>
      <data key="d1">condition</data>
      <data key="d2">A condition where the prostate gland becomes larger than normal.&lt;SEP&gt;A condition where the prostate gland is larger than normal, affecting PSA levels.</data>
