      <data key="d2">A blood test that measures the amount of prostate-specific antigen (PSA) in the bloodstream.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-081&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-089</data>
