    <node id="Chemoradiation">
      <data key="d0">Chemoradiation</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A combination of chemotherapy and radiation therapy used to treat cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;A treatment strategy that combines external beam radiation therapy and platinum-based chemotherapy.&lt;SEP&gt;A combination of chemotherapy and radiation therapy used to treat bladder cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;A combination of chemotherapy and radiation therapy.&lt;SEP&gt;A combination of chemotherapy and radiation therapy used to treat anal cancer.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-137&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-140&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-183&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-193&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-194</data>
