      <data key="d1">procedure</data>
      <data key="d2">A method to identify and remove lymph nodes most likely to contain cancer by injecting a special dye or a radioactive substance.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-138</data>
