    <node id="Hysterectomy">
      <data key="d0">Hysterectomy</data>
      <data key="d1">procedure</data>
      <data key="d2">A surgical procedure to remove the uterus.&lt;SEP&gt;Surgery that removes the uterus, including the cervix, and may involve removal of the ovaries.&lt;SEP&gt;Surgical removal of the uterus.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-138&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-140&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-141</data>
