    <node id="EBRT">
      <data key="d0">EBRT</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">External beam radiation therapy is a type of radiation therapy where a machine delivers radiation to the body from outside the body.&lt;SEP&gt;External beam radiation therapy, a type of radiation therapy that aims radiation at the cancer site.&lt;SEP&gt;External beam radiation therapy, a type of radiotherapy that uses high-energy beams to kill cancer cells.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-139&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-140&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3d7a4f05339f0e3f3870b407d21d9c8a-chunk-144</data>
